# Chat transcripts written by the legacy /api/chat/save route.
#
# That route wrote ONE shared file for every visitor and is now replaced by the
# authenticated, per-account NestJS chat history (NestJS chat_sessions /
# chat_messages). ~6.4MB of real user transcripts with inline base64 images had
# been committed here. The rule stops it coming back; it does NOT remove it from
# history, which would need a history rewrite.
src/data/chat_history.json
src/data/chat_history.json.tmp

# CodeSentry (separate product) lives here locally. Was committed in 48c3a6e as a
# gitlink to 64638ea, a commit that exists in no repository, with no
# .gitmodules -- so a fresh clone got an empty directory. Untracked; the
# tracked playground code is under src/app/api/playground and src/components/playground.
playground/
